{"id":"a1-u07","level":"a1","order":7,"title":{"en":"Sport and competition","fr":"Sport et compétition","es":"Deporte y competición","ar":"الرياضة والمنافسة"},"tip":{"en":"Sport is full of idioms: 'the ball is in your court', 'to move the goalposts', 'to throw in the towel'. Commentators use the present tense for live action.","fr":"Le sport regorge d'expressions imagées : « jeter l'éponge », « avoir la balle dans son camp ». Les commentateurs emploient le présent pour l'action en direct.","es":"El deporte está lleno de expresiones: «tirar la toalla», «tener la pelota en su tejado». Los comentaristas usan el presente para la acción en directo.","ar":"تزخر الرياضة بالتعابير المجازية: «رمى المنشفة» و«الكرة في ملعبك». ويستعمل المعلقون المضارع لوصف الحدث المباشر."},"words":48,"lessons":[{"id":"a1-u07-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"match, tournoi, championnat","fr":"partido, torneo, campeonato","es":"مباراة, بطولة, دوري","ar":"mubārāh، buṭūla، dawrī"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u07-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"entraîneur, arbitre, stade","fr":"entrenador, árbitro, estadio","es":"مدرب, حكم, ملعب","ar":"mudarrib، ḥakam، malʿab"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u07-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"champion, athlète, gardien de but","fr":"campeón, atleta, portero","es":"بطل, رياضي, حارس المرمى","ar":"baṭal، riyāḍī، ḥāris al-marma"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u07-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"but, penalty, faute","fr":"gol, penalti, falta","es":"هدف, ركلة جزاء, خطأ","ar":"hadaf، rakla jazāʾ، khaṭaʾ"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u07-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"victoire, défaite, record","fr":"victoria, derrota, récord","es":"فوز, هزيمة, رقم قياسي","ar":"fawz، hazīma، raqm qiyāsī"},"count":11},{"id":"a1-u07-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"entraînement, blessure, endurance","fr":"entrenamiento, lesión, resistencia","es":"تدريب, إصابة, تحمل","ar":"tadrīb، iṣāba، taḥammul"},"count":10},{"id":"a1-u07-l7","type":"learn","order":